      "source": "A node’s pivot is the transform between its coordinate space and that used by its [`simdPosition`](scnnode/simdposition.md), [`simdRotation`](scnnode/simdrotation.md), and [`simdScale`](scnnode/simdscale.md) properties.",
      "normalizedSource": "A node’s pivot is the transform between its coordinate space and that used by its [`simdPosition`](scnnode/simdposition.md), [`simdRotation`](scnnode/simdrotation.md), and [`simdScale`](scnnode/simdscale.md) properties.",
